---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="border-t border-steep-700 mt-20 bg-steep-800">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-10 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-sm">
    <div>
      <div class="inline-flex items-end">
        <span class="inline-block">
          <span class="wordmark-xxx text-2xl leading-none">xxx</span>
          <span class="wordmark-underbar" style="width:48px;height:2px;"></span>
        </span>
        <span class="wordmark-tea text-2xl leading-none ml-0.5">tea</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-3 text-steep-300 max-w-xs">
        Tea for adults. By varietal, by vessel, by brew. Nothing padded.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Browse</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="/reviews/">All reviews</a></li>
        <li><a href="/varietals/">By varietal</a></li>
        <li><a href="/vessels/">By vessel</a></li>
        <li><a href="/brewing/">Brewing guide</a></li>
        <li><a href="/gallery/">Gallery</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3">House</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><a href="/about/">About</a></li>
        <li><a href="/disclosure/">Affiliate disclosure</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact/">Contact</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Get in touch</p>
      <p class="text-steep-300 mb-3">Tips, corrections, teas we should review.</p>
      <a href="mailto:hello@xxxtea.com" class="font-display text-lg text-porcelain no-underline hover:text-honey-400">hello@xxxtea.com</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-steep-700 px-6 py-6 max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-steep-300">
    <p>&copy; {year} xxxtea. All opinions are our own.</p>
    <p>As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases. This costs you nothing.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
